WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.017 --> 00:00:08.532
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> <b>The Fortune Teller</b>

2
00:00:08.856 --> 00:00:09.646
<b>PART 1</b>

3
00:00:12.973 --> 00:00:19.615
One night in London, a young police inspector called McCleary had a conversation with his wife.

4
00:00:20.210 --> 00:00:27.176
‘My dear,’ said McCleary. ‘I can’t stop thinking about our neighbour, Mrs Myers.

5
00:00:27.539 --> 00:00:30.426
I’d love to know how she makes her money.

6
00:00:30.724 --> 00:00:35.527
She lives so luxuriously – she even buys asparagus in winter!’

7
00:00:36.252 --> 00:00:39.282
‘Leave it to me,’ said Mrs McCleary.

8
00:00:39.592 --> 00:00:40.783
‘I have an idea.’

9
00:00:42.428 --> 00:00:49.769
The next day, she dressed like a young girl, took off her wedding ring and went to visit Mrs Myers.

10
00:00:57.654 --> 00:01:01.525
‘Sit down, my child,’ said Mrs Myers.

11
00:01:05.745 --> 00:01:07.700
‘What can I do for you?’

12
00:01:08.037 --> 00:01:10.135
‘I’m going to be 20 tomorrow.

13
00:01:10.821 --> 00:01:13.889
I want to know what’s going to happen to me in the future.’

14
00:01:14.886 --> 00:01:19.275
Mrs Myers picked up a pack of cards and began to shuffle them.

15
00:01:21.515 --> 00:01:22.887
‘You are Miss…?’

16
00:01:24.894 --> 00:01:27.691
‘Jones,’ said Mrs McCleary, very quietly.

17
00:01:28.998 --> 00:01:32.611
‘My dear Miss Jones,’ said Mrs Myers.

18
00:01:32.999 --> 00:01:38.786
‘Please take five cards and put them on the table face down.’